tivo:<\/b> Sin Sistema Operativo<\/li><li>Dispositivo apuntador Touchpad T\u00e1ctil, Teclado num\u00e9rico<\/li><li><b>Bater\u00eda: <\/b>42Wh, 3 Celdas, Ion de litio<\/li><li>Seguridad Modulo de TPM con Protecci\u00f3n de Contrase\u00f1a<\/li><li><b>Dimensiones:<\/b> 360.3 x 232.5 x 17.9 mm<\/li><li><b>Peso: <\/b>1,63 Kg<\/li><li><b>Color:<\/b> Plata Fr\u00eda<\/li><\/ul><\/p><\/p><\/p><\/p>","images":"https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_asu-p%20e1504ga-nj468_1.jpg","wholesale_price":"265.79","unit_price_tax":270.79},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["4711387407141"],"reference":"90NB0ZT1-M00RZ0","name":{"1":"Port\u00e1til Asus VivoBook Go 15 E1504GA-NJ468 Intel Core i3-N305\/ 8GB\/ 256GB SSD\/ 15.6'\/ Sin Sistema Operativo","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"<p><h2>\u00a1Vaya con su productividad!<\/h2><p>Es ligero. Es compacto. Es el ASUS Vivobook Go 15, y est\u00e1 dise\u00f1ado para que sea productivo y entretenido dondequiera que vaya. Con su bisagra plana de 180\u00b0, protector f\u00edsico para c\u00e1mara web y un mont\u00f3n de caracter\u00edsticas de dise\u00f1o bien pensadas \u00a1el Vivobook Go 15 es el port\u00e1til que lo libera!<\/p><h2><br><\/h2><h2>Especificaciones<\/h2><p><p><p><ul><li><b>CPU:<\/b> Intel Core i3-N305 (8 N\u00facleos, Cach\u00e9: 6MB, hasta 3.8GHz)<\/li><li><b>RAM:<\/b> 8GB DDR4-SDRAM<\/li><li><b>Almacenamiento:<\/b>&nbsp;256GB SSD M.2 NVMe PCIe\u00ae 3.0<\/li><li><b>Gr\u00e1ficos:<\/b> Intel UHD Graphics<\/li><li><b>Pantalla:<\/b> 15.6' (39,62cm) \/ FHD (1920x1080\/16:9) \/ TN \/ Antirreflejos \/ NTSC:45% \/ Brillo 250 cd\/m2 \/ 60 Hz<\/li><li><b>Webcam<\/b>&nbsp;HD con obturador de privacidad<\/li><li><b>Conectividad y redes:<\/b> Wi-Fi 6E (802.11ax)\/ 1x1 \/ Bluetooth\u00ae 5.3<\/li><li><b>Conexiones:<\/b><\/li><ul><li>1 x USB 2.0<\/li><li>1 x USB A 3.2 Gen1<\/li><li>1 x USB-C\u00ae 3.2 Gen1<\/li><li>1 x Combo de salida de auriculares \/ micr\u00f3fono del puerto<\/li><li>1 x HDMI 1.4<\/li><li>1 x Entrada de Alimentaci\u00f3n (CC)<\/li><li>1 x Adaptador 4.5mm<\/li><\/ul><li><b>Sistema operativo:<\/b> Sin Sistema Operativo<\/li><li>Dispositivo apuntador Touchpad T\u00e1ctil, Teclado num\u00e9rico<\/li><li><b>Bater\u00eda: <\/b>42Wh, 3 Celdas, Ion de litio<\/li><li>Seguridad Modulo de TPM con Protecci\u00f3n de Contrase\u00f1a<\/li><li><b>Dimensiones:<\/b> 360.3 x 232.5 x 17.9 mm<\/li><li><b>Peso: <\/b>1,63 Kg<\/li><li><b>Color:<\/b> Plata Fr\u00eda<\/li><\/ul><\/p><\/p><\/p><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"ASUS","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":2.55,"unit_price":270.79,"unit_price_tax":270.79,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Portatiles","sub_category":"Portatiles","quantity":5,"brand":"ASUS","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_asu-p%20e1504ga-nj468_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":265.79}}},"0198828259493":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["0198828259493",false],"wholesale_price":[468.75,false],"price":[473.75,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 2.37",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:242970","Cat. IDs: 2","Associated Categories","Cat. Default: 2","Deleted old images","New images created","Add: \/home\/hipermercado\/public_html\/img\/tmp\/fd27e7882e9702fe9eea41679fd34ae9.jpg; <br>-------------------------------"],"result":true},"feed_data":{"name_pt":"Port\u00e1til HP 250 G10 AD0Z8ET Intel Core i7-1355U\/ 16GB\/ 512GB SSD\/ 15.6'\/ 